1
00:00:00,054 --> 00:00:02,224
(Nathan Fillion:)Oh, yeah, I get it--
you think I'm Nathan Fillion,

2
00:00:02,223 --> 00:00:03,723
(Nathan Fillion:)but I'm not.

3
00:00:03,724 --> 00:00:06,224
(Nathan Fillion:)So if you don't mind, I would
just love to eat my lunch.

4
00:00:07,528 --> 00:00:08,528
(Raj:)Come on.

5
00:00:08,529 --> 00:00:10,359
(Leonard:)Sorry to bother you.

6
00:00:10,364 --> 00:00:12,364
(Raj:)Don't know why
he's so grumpy.

7
00:00:12,366 --> 00:00:14,696
(Raj:)I got mistaken for that guy
in Life of Pi once,

8
00:00:14,702 --> 00:00:17,132
(Raj:)and I'm still
floating.

9
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,640
(Amy:)Sheldon, it's me.

10
00:00:22,643 --> 00:00:23,643
(Penny:)Oh, hey.

11
00:00:23,644 --> 00:00:25,474
D-Did you see that?

12
00:00:25,479 --> 00:00:29,119
I-I figured out how to open
the door all by myself.

13
00:00:30,684 --> 00:00:34,584
Maybe I'll fling some feces
around my cage to celebrate.

14
00:00:35,856 --> 00:00:38,026
(Amy:)What are you talking about?

15
00:00:38,025 --> 00:00:40,355
(Penny:)I know you've been giving me
secret puzzle tests.

16
00:00:43,297 --> 00:00:44,967
(Amy:)Sheldon, open
the door.

17
00:00:44,965 --> 00:00:46,635
SHELDON:
I can't.

18
00:00:46,634 --> 00:00:49,634
(Sheldon:)I'm naked.

19
00:00:49,637 --> 00:00:51,637
(Amy:)I just saw you.

20
00:00:51,639 --> 00:00:53,939
(Sheldon:)Hang on.

21
00:00:53,941 --> 00:00:56,511
(Penny:)Open the door now.

22
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:58,180
(door opens)
Oh, hey.
Pull up your pants!

